{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226920","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226920","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422692001:1":{"text":"她不会再重生了吗？","source_cn":"她不会再重生了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBB79A58FCFE30A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1422692001":{"text":"她不会再重生了吗？","source_cn":"她不会再重生了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBB79A58FCFE30A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422692002:1":{"text":"嗯，我能感到皎月树的气息，还有鹿灵，那样喜悦……","source_cn":"嗯，我能感到皎月树的气息，还有鹿灵，那样喜悦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE94782D3C9DEB330","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422692004:1":{"text":"鹿灵……已经将所有的过去传达给我了。","source_cn":"鹿灵……已经将所有的过去传达给我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB2A6D668D7C4933","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422692005:1":{"text":"当年……弥萨忒面临着两难抉择——恶魔已经寄生于翡绿之卵，无法完全净化。","source_cn":"当年……弥萨忒面临着两难抉择——恶魔已经寄生于翡绿之卵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D4BC446F74CF76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422692006:1